{"code":200,"message":"","data":[{"created_at":"2025-06-17","fileName":"SN30 Pro+","firmware_type":25,"firmware_key":"2012","file_version":"6.02","ic_version":"","fileSize":99868,"fileURL":"https:\/\/support.8bitdo.com\/bd-uploads\/files\/old\/4a0e8ba2-02bb-478d-8b70-18104510cb09.dat","exists":true,"readme":"1. \u65b0\u589e\u652f\u6301 Switch 2 \u4e3b\u673a\u3002","readme_en":"1. Added support for Switch 2.","beta":0,"md5":"8807A1D43F55F50821163C907B19C8E8"},{"created_at":"2023-10-11","fileName":"SN30 Pro+","firmware_type":25,"firmware_key":"1737","file_version":"6.01","ic_version":"","fileSize":94748,"fileURL":"https:\/\/support.8bitdo.com\/bd-uploads\/files\/old\/36492f1b-0b1b-473f-bcf1-2850b3b2140f.dat","exists":true,"readme":"1. \u8c03\u6574\u542f\u7528 \/ \u5173\u95ed\u914d\u7f6e\u7ec4\u5408\u952e\u4e3a L3+R3+L1+R1\uff08\u539f\u7ec4\u5408\u952e\u4e3a L3+R3\uff09\u3002\r\n2. \u4f18\u5316 Xinput \u6a21\u5f0f\u7684\u6447\u6746\u6b7b\u533a\u8303\u56f4\u3002\r\n3. \u4f18\u5316 Switch \u6a21\u5f0f\u7684\u632f\u52a8\u6548\u679c\u3002\r\n4. \u4fee\u590d Switch \u6a21\u5f0f\u632f\u52a8\u5f02\u5e38\u7684\u95ee\u9898\u3002\r\n5. \u4fee\u590d\u8fde\u63a5 PS \u63a5\u6536\u5668\u632f\u52a8\u5f02\u5e38\u7684\u95ee\u9898\u3002","readme_en":"1. The button combo to activate\/deactivate the profile has changed to [L3+R3+L1+R1].\r\n2. Optimized the dead zone range of the analog sticks in Xinput mode.\r\n3. Optimized the vibration of the Switch mode.\r\n4. Fixed the abnormal vibration issue in Switch mode.\r\n5. Fixed the abnormal vibration issue when connecting to the PS Retro Receiver.","beta":0,"md5":"1572466C21075FCF1A366FE5AE74E59B"},{"created_at":"2021-11-16","fileName":"SN30 Pro+","firmware_type":25,"firmware_key":"1619","file_version":"5.04","ic_version":"","fileSize":93724,"fileURL":"https:\/\/support.8bitdo.com\/bd-uploads\/files\/old\/3c0be0ba-a989-47ee-aaaa-3cf13e17be30.dat","exists":true,"readme":"1. \u4fee\u590d Switch \u6a21\u5f0f\u4f4e\u7535\u91cf\u663e\u793a\u9519\